ithub.com/users/dezren39/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":26,"created_at":"2026-10-29T07:16:38Z","updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:24:45Z","closed_at":"2026-11-09T09:24:15Z","assignee":{"login":"dezren39","id":11225574,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjI1NTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11225574?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39","html_url":"https://github.com/dezren39","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"status":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Split of #1919 (Approach C, part 4) by triage task 2814 on 2026-10-29. Full analysis lives on #1919; this issue tracks only the shared-resolution slice.\n\n## Scope\nOne script-resolution rule for every surface: move `resolveScript` out of `internal/cli` into a package `internal/execsvc` can call; the daemon resolves `/v1/exec`'s `file` the same way the CLI does — search path, `null` splice, extension list, and the same error naming every directory searched. CLI resolve-locally-send-text stays the default for `--remote`; a `--remote-file` / `file:` form asks the daemon to resolve. Exec flags on daemon-resolved runs are carried on the wire or explicitly refused (the `--export` precedent); `--export` becomes possible when the daemon resolved the file.\n\nOut of scope: shebang dispatch / `script.interpreter` / `script.cwd` (#1919 parts 1–3 — the sibling split issue).\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n- [ ] `resolveScript` lives in a shared package used by both the CLI and the daemon path (no forked copies).\n- [ ] `POST /v1/exec {\"file\": \"report\"}` finds `report.ts` on the daemon's search path; a miss errors naming every directory searched.\n- [ ] CLI `--remote` default unchanged; `--remote-file` form documented in `docs/exec.md` alongside the corrected remote-run description.\n- [ ] The `paths.scripts` scope question from #1919 (shared setting vs daemon-specific) answered on #1919 or here.\n- [ ] Daemon-resolution tests mirroring the CLI's `resolveScript` tests pass in CI (`pkgs/mcpx`: `go test ./...` via CI).\n","closed_by":{"login":"dezren39","id":11225574,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjI1NTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11225574?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39","html_url":"https://github.com/dezren39","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/